.TH CAPSET 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
capset \- sets linux thread capabilities using the kernel header and data layout
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/capability.h>
.B int capset(cap_user_header_t header, const struct __user_cap_data_struct* data);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Sets Linux thread capabilities using the kernel header and data layout. Versions 2 and 3 require two data elements.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result on success, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR capset (2)
